--[[
Calculator: the four operations, percent and sign, as a Mac's Calculator
in its basic form.

  saule run .

    Calculator      what is on the display and what has been asked for,
                    without the window
    CalculatorView  the display and the keys

The keys of the keyboard work too: digits, + - * /, Enter or = for the
answer, % , Backspace to take a digit back, Escape or C to clear.
]]

from CalculatorApp import CalculatorApp

class Main
  static fn main()
    CalculatorApp().run()
  end
end
